<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Self-Care Practices - Tellngrow</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 min-h-screen">
  {{> sidebar}}
  
  <nav class="bg-white shadow-md p-4">
    <div class="container mx-auto flex justify-between items-center">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
        <button onclick="openSidebar()" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-purple-600 focus:outline-none">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"></path>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-600">🌱 Tellngrow</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="container mx-auto p-6 max-w-4xl">
    <a href="/reading" class="inline-flex items-center text-purple-600 hover:text-purple-700 mb-6">
      <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"></path>
      </svg>
      Back to Reading Materials
    </a>

    <article class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8">
      <div class="mb-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="text-xs bg-pink-100 text-pink-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Wellness</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">4 min read</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">❤️ Self-Care Practices</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">Essential self-care activities to maintain your mental and physical health.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="h-64 bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-500 to-rose-500 rounded-lg mb-8 flex items-center justify-center">
        <span class="text-8xl">❤️</span>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">What is Self-Care?</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Self-care is any activity that we do deliberately to take care of our mental, emotional, and physical health. It's not selfish—it's essential for maintaining good health and well-being.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Types of Self-Care</h2>
        
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">Physical Self-Care</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 mb-4">
          <li>Regular exercise or movement</li>
          <li>Eating nutritious meals</li>
          <li>Getting adequate sleep</li>
          <li>Attending medical check-ups</li>
          <li>Taking breaks when needed</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">Emotional Self-Care</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 mb-4">
          <li>Journaling your thoughts and feelings</li>
          <li>Talking to a therapist or counselor</li>
          <li>Practicing self-compassion</li>
          <li>Setting healthy boundaries</li>
          <li>Allowing yourself to feel emotions</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">Social Self-Care</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 mb-4">
          <li>Spending time with loved ones</li>
          <li>Joining clubs or groups with shared interests</li>
          <li>Reaching out to friends</li>
          <li>Setting boundaries in relationships</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">Mental Self-Care</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 mb-4">
          <li>Reading books or learning new things</li>
          <li>Practicing mindfulness or meditation</li>
          <li>Engaging in creative activities</li>
          <li>Limiting social media and news consumption</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Creating Your Self-Care Plan</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Start small and be consistent. Choose 2-3 self-care activities from different categories and commit to doing them regularly. Remember, self-care looks different for everyone—find what works for you.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-pink-50 border-l-4 border-pink-500 p-6 my-8">
          <p class="text-pink-900 font-semibold mb-2">💖 Remember:</p>
          <p class="text-pink-800">
            Self-care isn't selfish. You can't pour from an empty cup. Taking care of yourself allows you to better care for others.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
